.TH "CSSPERSPECTIVE.LENGTH" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSPerspective.length \- CSSPerspective: length property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]length\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]CSSPerspective\f[R] interface represents the distance from z=0.
.PP
It is used to apply a perspective transform to the element and its
content.
If the value is 0 or a negative number, no perspective transform is
applied.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSNumericValue\f[R]
